The ledger on main holds 20 ACCEPTED, 1 FIXED, 2 WONTFIX, 96 OPEN; the dashboard
counts rows logged at 00:04Z and will read 17 until midnight whatever anyone does.

Until now this defect was stale -- a resolved incident reported as open. It has
crossed into false: the condition was fixed, and the instrument cannot say so
because it counts events rather than reading state. An operator reading that line
