A stale number trains a reader to ignore a line. A number that cannot follow a fix
trains them to distrust the work.

Still batched with the other two dashboard defects rather than patched mid-check:
all three are display semantics in one file, and each needs a proof that bites the
rendered string rather than a helper's return value.

